"El document de conferència de %(invoice)s no és XML analitzable: %(error)s"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/components/edi_input_process_l10n_pt_spms_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The check document of %(invoice)s reports an unknown EstadoFactura: "
"%(estado)s"
msgstr ""
"El document de conferència de %(invoice)s informa d'un EstadoFactura "
"desconegut: %(estado)s"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/components/edi_input_process_l10n_pt_spms_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The check document of %s carries no FacturasErrosEDiferencas extension."
msgstr ""
"El document de conferència de %s no porta l'extensió "
"FacturasErrosEDiferencas."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The check result of %(invoice)s does not match any recognised outcome "
"(official credit: %(value)s); it is held for human review. The raw document "
"attached to this result is the authority."
msgstr ""
"El resultat de conferència de %(invoice)s no correspon a cap desenllaç "
"reconegut (crèdit oficial: %(value)s); queda retingut per a revisió humana. "
"El document en brut adjunt a aquest resultat és l'autoritat."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/components/edi_input_process_l10n_pt_spms_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The check result of %s is already carried by a live credit note; cancel that"
" credit note before reprocessing the document."
msgstr ""
"El resultat de conferència de %s ja el porta una factura rectificativa viva;"
" cancel·leu aquesta factura rectificativa abans de reprocessar el document."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The credit note total %(total).2f still differs from the official value "
"%(official).2f after imposing the tax amount."
msgstr ""
"El total de la factura rectificativa %(total).2f continua diferint del valor"
" oficial %(official).2f després d'imposar l'import de l'impost."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The draft tax amount (%(draft).2f) differs from the expected tax "
"(%(expected).2f) for the taxes on its lines; review the tax configuration "
"before retrying."
msgstr ""
"L'import d'impostos de l'esborrany (%(draft).2f) difereix de l'impost "
"esperat (%(expected).2f) per als impostos de les seves línies; reviseu la "
"configuració d'impostos abans de tornar-ho a intentar."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The draft untaxed total (%(draft).2f) differs from the prescription claims "
"total (%(expected).2f); review the draft lines before retrying."
msgstr ""
"El total sense impostos de l'esborrany (%(draft).2f) difereix del total de "
"prestacions per prescripció (%(expected).2f); reviseu les línies de "
"l'esborrany abans de tornar-ho a intentar."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/components/edi_input_process_l10n_pt_spms_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The exchange record %s is not linked to an invoice."
msgstr "El registre d'intercanvi %s no està vinculat a cap factura."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The invoice already has a live credit note this module did not create: %s. "
"Only one credit note may exist per invoice; fix or cancel it in accounting "
"first."
msgstr ""
"La factura ja té una factura rectificativa viva que aquest mòdul no ha "
"creat: %s. Només pot existir una factura rectificativa per factura; "
"corregiu-la o cancel·leu-la abans a comptabilitat."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The official value %(value)s exceeds the total of the original invoice "
"%(invoice)s (%(total)s)."
msgstr ""
"El valor oficial %(value)s supera el total de la factura original "
"%(invoice)s (%(total)s)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The official value of %s is already carried by a credit note; cancel that "
"credit note first to change it."
msgstr ""
"El valor oficial de %s ja el porta una factura rectificativa; cancel·leu "
"abans aquesta factura rectificativa per canviar-lo."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__oficio
msgid ""
"The ofício, the official letter the CCF communicates with the check result, "
"as received."
msgstr ""
"L'ofici, la carta oficial que el CCF comunica amb el resultat de "
"conferència, tal com es rep."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The original invoice %s is not posted."
msgstr "La factura original %s no està publicada."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The remaining difference %(difference).2f between the official value "
"%(official).2f and the credit note total %(total).2f exceeds one rounding "
"step (%(step).2f); it cannot be absorbed by the imposed tax amount."
msgstr ""
"La diferència restant %(difference).2f entre el valor oficial %(official).2f"
" i el total de la factura rectificativa %(total).2f supera un pas "
"d'arrodoniment (%(step).2f); no es pot absorbir imposant l'import de "
"l'impost."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "The result is no longer ready (current state: %s)."
msgstr "El resultat ja no està llest (estat actual: %s)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The standard reversal did not create a single draft credit note for %s."
msgstr ""
"La reversió estàndard no ha creat una única factura rectificativa esborrany "
"per a %s."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "There is no prescription with a difference to credit."
msgstr "No hi ha cap prescripció amb diferència per abonar."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__total_allowed
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.spms_invoice_line_check_view_tree
