msgstr "Total admès (amb impostos)"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__total_billed
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.spms_invoice_line_check_view_tree
msgid "Total Billed"
msgstr "Total facturat"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__total_billed_taxed
msgid "Total Billed (Taxed)"
msgstr "Total facturat (amb impostos)"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.spms_invoice_line_check_view_tree
msgid "Total Difference"
msgstr "Diferència total"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_line_check__lot_type
msgid "Type of the lot the claim belongs to (TipoLote)."
msgstr "Tipus del lot al qual pertany la prestació (TipoLote)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check_error__error_type_id
msgid ""
"Type of this error in the shared SPMS error-type master; unknown codes are "
"auto-created there as pending classification."
msgstr ""
"Tipus d'aquest error al mestre compartit de tipus d'error SPMS; els codis "
"desconeguts s'hi creen automàticament com a pendents de classificació."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid "Unexpected generation failure; see the server log."
msgstr "Fallada de generació inesperada; consulteu el registre del servidor."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/components/edi_input_process_l10n_pt_spms_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Unparseable %(field)s of prescription %(prescription)s: %(text)s (stored as "
"0)."
msgstr ""
"%(field)s il·legible de la prescripció %(prescription)s: %(text)s (desat com"
" a 0)."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.spms_invoice_check_view_search
msgid "WS Incident"
msgstr "Incidència WS"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__ws_incident_code
msgid "WS Incident Code"
msgstr "Codi d'incidència WS"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__fetch_date
msgid "When the definitive check document was fetched from the web service."
msgstr ""
"Quan es va obtenir el document de conferència definitiu del servei web."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__generation_error
msgid ""
"Why the automatic credit-note generation of this result failed; the result "
"is held in Error until the cause is fixed and the document is reprocessed. "
"Other results of the same batch are never dragged along."
msgstr ""
"Per què ha fallat la generació automàtica de la factura rectificativa "
"d'aquest resultat; el resultat es reté en Error fins que es corregeix la "
"causa i es reprocessa el document. Els altres resultats del mateix lot mai "
"no s'hi veuen arrossegats."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__error_message
msgid ""
"Why the result is held in error: a live credit note this module did not "
"create, a web-service incident, or a check outcome this module does not "
"recognise. Computed live and never stored, so fixing the cause clears it on "
"its own."
msgstr ""
"Per què el resultat està retingut en error: una factura rectificativa viva "
"que aquest mòdul no ha creat, una incidència del servei web o un desenllaç "
"de conferència que aquest mòdul no reconeix. Es calcula en viu i mai no "
"s'emmagatzema, així que corregir la causa ho neteja per si sol."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.selection__spms_invoice_check__state__zero_official
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.spms_invoice_check_view_search
msgid "Zero Official Value"
msgstr "Valor oficial zero"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_res_company__spms_adjustment_limit
msgid "SPMS Adjustment Limit"
msgstr "Límit d'ajust SPMS"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_res_company__spms_adjustment_limit
msgid ""
"Largest difference, taxes included, between the official value and the "
"credit-note lines total that the adjustment line may absorb: rounding cents. "
"A larger difference holds the result in error for review instead of "
"generating the credit note."
msgstr ""
"Diferència més gran, impostos inclosos, entre el valor oficial i el total de "
"les línies de la nota de crèdit que la línia d'ajust pot absorbir: cèntims "
"d'arrodoniment. Una diferència més gran deixa el resultat en error per "
"revisar-lo en lloc de generar la nota de crèdit."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.constraint_res_company_spms_adjustment_limit_positive
msgid "The SPMS adjustment limit cannot be negative."
msgstr "El límit d'ajust SPMS no pot ser negatiu."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__amount_lines_negative_untaxed
msgid "Negative Claims Amount (Untaxed)"
msgstr "Import de prestacions negatives (sense impostos)"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.field_spms_invoice_check__amount_lines_negative_untaxed
msgid ""
"Sum of the negative differences, without taxes: the claims the check allowed "
"above the billed amount. Each one becomes a negative line of the credit "
"note, netting against the over-billed claims exactly as the official value "
"does."
msgstr ""
"Suma de les diferències negatives, sense impostos: les prestacions que la "
"comprovació ha admès per sobre de l'import facturat. Cadascuna es converteix "
"en una línia negativa de la nota de crèdit, que compensa les prestacions "
"facturades de més exactament com fa el valor oficial."

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check.spms_invoice_check_view_form
msgid "Negative Claims"
msgstr "Prestacions negatives"

#. module: l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check
#: code:addons/l10n_pt_invoice_spms_check/models/spms_invoice_check.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The credit-note total %(draft)s differs from the official value %(official)s "
"by %(difference)s, beyond the SPMS adjustment limit %(limit)s of company "
"%(company)s; review the check lines before retrying."
msgstr ""
"El total de la nota de crèdit %(draft)s difereix del valor oficial "
"%(official)s en %(difference)s, més enllà del límit d'ajust SPMS %(limit)s "
"de l'empresa %(company)s; reviseu les línies de la comprovació abans de "
"tornar-ho a provar."
